		(property "Description" "SF32LB52-MOD-1 is a general-purpose low-power Bluetooth MCU module, which adopts SiFli's SF32LB525UC6 chip and Arm Cortex-M33 STAR-MC1 dual-core processor, with an operating frequency of up to 240MHz.The module has a rich set of peripheral interfaces, including GPIO, SPI, LCD, MPI, UART, I2C, PWM, SDIO, USB2.0 FS, analog audio input and output, UART, I2C, PWM, SDIO, USB2.0 FS, analog audio input and output."
